title: ASF Sponsorship Discounts
description: The Apache Software Foundation (ASF) is grateful for the support of our sponsors, who help make our events possible. If you are interested in sponsoring an upcoming event, please contact us at


Platinum and Gold Sponsors of the Apache Software Foundation can opt-in for a discounted conference sponsorship rate, bundled with their ASF sponsorship package.
Contact us today for more information on event sponsorship at sponsors@apachecon.com.

## Platinum

If you are a [[]Platinum ASF sponsor](https://www.apache.org/foundation/sponsorship.html#platinum), you can choose to include a platinum sponsorship for Community Over Code NA 2025 for an additional $28,000 (a 25% discount). This benefit includes a sponsor keynote, break-out session, a full marketing/logo package, and 12 conference passes.

## Gold

If you are a [[]Gold ASF sponsor](https://www.apache.org/foundation/sponsorship.html#gold), you can choose to include a gold sponsorship for Community Over Code NA 2025 for an additional $17,000 (a 15% discount). This benefit includes a sponsor break-out session, a full marketing/logo package, and 10 conference passes.

## Questions?

If these packages interest you, or you would like to know more, reach out to our Corporate Sponsorship team!

<a href="mailto:events-sponsorship@apache.org" class="btn">Contact Us</a>